      "description": "General Info:\nThe VM-3A \u201cLocust\u201d Gunship is a multirole rotorwing aircraft. It was designed to serve as both an utility and attack tiltrotor in a single package. Due to being heavily armed as well as keeping the cargo capabilities, it is much heavier, requiring it\u2019s more advanced engine.\n\nThe Locust has a cargo area which is commonly used to transport personel. In case of a logistics mission, the passenger seats can be removed, allowing for additional cargo space. Hook points are mounted on the skid for slingloading operations, allowing the Locust to carry extra or oversized cargo externally.\n\nCrew:\nThe \"Locust\" can fit 11 occupants: 1 pilot, 2 door gunners and 8 passengers.\n\nThe pilot has access to: 2x GAU 26-C Dual Gatling Gun, 2x VF-45 WAFAR Missile Pod, 8x Falcon AGM-217 HELLFIRE Missile\n\nThe door gunner has access to: MKR-23 Light Machine Gun",
