      "description": "Noburo Heavy Fighter - The coolest fighter sized ship you will find on the StarMade Dock!\n\nThis is the Fighter sized ship of the Klawxx Dominion Faction. You may fly it only if you have the \"Awesomely Special Forces Flight License TM\"(A.K.A: ASFFL) from the Klawxx Dominion Navy... Just Kidding: These babies look so cool that they have been smuggled to all the corners of the known universe and everyone can buy one, If they have the credits. Emperor Klawxx turn a blind eye to this black market operation, since it allowed him to be known as an incredible ruler and ship designer throughout the entire universe.\n\nDimensions (Main Fuselage):\n+Length: 23 m\n+Height 13 m\n+Width: 33 m\n\nStatistics:\n+ Mass: 240.5\n+ Shields: 72,000 (2,000 s/sec.)\n+ Power: 4,900 e/sec. (100% stable with 10% buffer)\n+ Thrust ratio: 2.5\n\nWeapons:\n+ 75mm GAU Laser auto-cannon (Logic controlled, three barreled cannon!)\n+ Dual Heavy Missile System (Lock-on Missile x2)",
